{"lyrics":"[00:01.42]This one we surfin'? Surfs up, wave, uh-huh, ayy (Let's go, let's go)\n[00:09.80](808 Mafia)\n[00:10.06]808\n[00:10.24], 150 No Limit Gang (O-oh)\n[00:11.46]Triple nine, fuck what you claim (O-oh)\n[00:14.28]I'ma pull up in a Bentley, bitch ride me just like a ten speed\n[00:17.24]Got a .40 with 30s, the auto or semi, extended clip, I got plenty\n[00:20.38]I count rack after rack, pour the red, I'm a slatt\n[00:22.36]My gun just like a bitch, it's sittin' on my lap\n[00:24.08]I'm a rebel, play heavy metal in the trap\n[00:25.94]Got the red when I pop the Phantom in the back (Yeah)\n[00:28.36]My money old, London bridge\n[00:30.16]She babysit, swallow kids\n[00:31.90]Still wanna hate? Hollow tips\n[00:33.76]Hop in the whip, Grand Theft Auto my clip\n[00:35.22]Suck my dick like a baby bottle, pop and dip\n[00:37.04]Hit 'em with it like Ronda Rousey, but I win\n[00:38.86]All these niggas that heard about me, they be worried 'bout me, they be really scary 'bout the kid\n[00:42.42]That's Givenchy my kicks, I'll never kick it with 'em\n[00:44.22]If you forgot the drip, Balenciaga denim\n[00:46.02]To a hood nigga, True Religion on the denim\n[00:47.68]Ain't no polyester, Versace on the linen\n[00:49.54]Fucked her rolled off the perkies, kitty, I'ma kill it\n[00:51.30]Bullets land on your face, it aimin' for a kiss\n[00:53.00]Diamonds shine like a star, Orion or Achilles\n[00:54.84]Sagittarius, horoscope on the semi\n[00:56.90]I'ma pull up in a Bentley, bitch ride me just like a ten speed\n[00:59.72]Got a .40 with 30s, the auto or semi, extended clip, I got plenty\n[01:03.34]I count rack after rack, pour the red, I'm a slatt\n[01:05.02]My gun just like a bitch, it's sittin' on my lap\n[01:06.82]I'm a rebel, play heavy metal in the trap\n[01:08.60]Got the red when I pop the Phantom in the back (Yeah)\n[01:11.14]I pop the phantom, pop out\n[01:12.88]Every day, I keep my Glock out\n[01:14.70]I take your bitch to a cock-mouth, wanna see what her slot 'bout\n[01:18.16]Benjamin Franklin right now, I need Benjamin right now\n[01:21.76]Ruger nueve, got 'em breathin' heavy\n[01:23.26]I'm the motherfuckin' boss of the sauce, El Jefe\n[01:25.10]Tempted, money on my head, yeah\n[01:32.38]Pull up to your bitch house, say she gon' be right out\n[01:34.18]Backwood smoke, no White Owl, White Owl\n[01:35.96]He ain't got a gun, so he say he tryna fight now\n[01:37.74]Mama said knock your lights out, lights out\n[01:39.56]In V.I.P. in the club with the ice out\n[01:41.26]Two-hundred thou and three deals for the bling-blaow\n[01:43.14]I'm the type of nigga to get a TV show\n[01:44.62]Just to beat your ass, call me Jerry Spring' now\n[01:46.48]Gucci shades on, I don't even see these hoes\n[01:48.22]Purp' Rain like Prince, pour up 'til I pass out\n[01:50.10]After I smash, I'm doin' the dash\n[01:51.82]It's back to the cash, I live on the cash route\n[02:10.18]Tempted, money on my head, yeah\n[02:20.12](Tempted, money on my head, yeah)\n[02:45.60]I'ma pull up in a Bentley, bitch ride me just like a ten speed\n[02:57.08]Got a .40 with 30s, the auto or semi, extended clip, I got plenty\n[03:10.26]I count rack after rack, pour the red, I'm a slatt\n[03:17.74]My gun just like a bitch, it's sittin' on my lap\n[03:29.36]I'm a rebel, play heavy metal in the trap\n[03:37.98]Got the red when I pop the Phantom in the back","words":[[1.42,1.66,"This"],[1.72,1.78,"one"],[1.82,1.84,"we"],[1.92,2.6,"surfin'?"],[3.0,3.22,"Surfs"],[3.36,3.4,"up,"],[3.88,4.06,"wave,"],[4.8,5.72,"uh-huh,"],[5.78,6.22,"ayy"],[6.72,9.06,"(Let's"],[9.12,9.14,"go,"],[9.2,9.44,"let's"],[9.72,9.78,"go)"],[9.8,9.82,"(808"],[9.86,10.04,"Mafia)"],[10.06,10.24,"808"],[10.24,10.28,","],[10.28,10.32,"150"],[10.36,10.42,"No"],[10.62,10.92,"Limit"],[11.02,11.3,"Gang"],[11.34,11.42,"(O-oh)"],[11.46,11.82,"Triple"],[11.92,12.12,"nine,"],[12.18,12.36,"fuck"],[12.42,12.56,"what"],[12.62,12.7,"you"],[12.76,13.04,"claim"],[14.14,14.24,"(O-oh)"],[14.28,14.34,"I'ma"],[14.44,14.62,"pull"],[14.